CHAPTER.VERS:
All [of] the commandment which I command you this day you

          {+}
         will observe to do, that you

          {+}
         may live, and multiply, and go in and possess the land which Yahweh swore to your

          {+}
         fathers.

And it will be, if you will forget Yahweh your God, and walk after other gods, and serve them, and worship them, I testify against you

          {+}
         this day that you

          {+}
         will surely perish.

As the nations that Yahweh makes to perish before you

          {+}
        , so you

          {+}
         will perish; because you

          {+}
         would not listen to the voice of Yahweh your

          {+}
         God.
